<title>UK: YTV in takeover talks with Granada.</title>
<headline>YTV in takeover talks with Granada.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yorkshire-Tyne Tees Television Holdings Plc confirmed on Monday it is in talks with Granada Group Plc about an offer by Granada for the shares in YTV it does not already own.</p>
<p>The offer would value Yorkshire shares at 11.75 pounds ($19.17) per share. Yorkshire's shares had closed 57-1/2 pence higher at 11.65 pounds on Monday.</p>
